        "date": "2026-11-13T20:49:12Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(setup): a machine or post picked on one setup never re-mounts another\n\nWith two or more setups, a machine verb (library pick, Load other,\nEdit apply, Clear, catalogue assign, mode switch) or a post pick on a\nsetup that follows the document now makes the pick that setup's own\n(SetSetupMachine / SetSetupPost, undoable) instead of writing the\ndocument's mount every other following setup reads. One setup keeps\nwriting the document's machine as before. The setup's Machine and Post\npages say by name where a pick lands.\n\nFixes #1515\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
