      },
      "message": "test(ui): the setup Post page names the post's target, not the machine's\n\nReview of #1527: `Mount::Post => state.post_target()` could be swapped for\n`machine_target()` and stay green. One setup that owns its machine but\nfollows the document's post now pins the Post page's line: it names the\ndocument's post, never \"Setup1's own\".\n\nRefs #1515\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
